---
/** Quant Control · operations */
---
<section id="operations" class="view section" data-view="operations" hidden>
      <div class="section-title">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">OPERATIONS</p>
          <h2>台帳・リスク・プリセット</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2">
        <section class="panel">
          <div class="panel-head"><h3>台帳カウント</h3></div>
          <div id="ledger-counts" class="count-grid"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="panel">
          <div class="panel-head"><h3>運用プリセット</h3></div>
          <div id="presets" class="preset-list"></div>
        </section>
      </div>
      <p class="muted ops-note">判断・注文・約定の詳細テーブルは下の「接続・台帳・学習操作」または運用デスク側にあります。</p>
    </section>
